OL,3,GNEWSAResidents win Curo service charge
OL,4,Alegal battle
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents living in a block of flats
OL,7,Fhave won a legal battle against their
OL,8,Fhousing association - after being faced
OL,9,Fwith a service charge increase of more
OL,10,Fthan 300 per cent.
OL,12,FNine families living in
OL,13,FWeston-super-Mare in Somerset had seen
OL,14,Ftheir monthly fees go up from about #70
OL,15,Fper month to more than #300 a month.
OL,17,FHousing provider Curo has now agreed to
OL,18,Flimit the charge to just over #100
OL,19,Fafter being taken to tribunal.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
